  "title": "Pasta with Salami and Peas",
  "description": "This recipe is SUPER simple and incredibly tasty. If you like Pasta Aglio Olio (pasta with garlic and olive oil), you’ll LOVE this. The salty, garlicky salami with the sweet green peas -- MMMM! You’ll find yourself making it all the time!",
